1. Definitions

"You" means the individual or legal entity exercising rights under this
license. "Organization" means You and, if You are a legal entity, every
entity that controls, is controlled by, or is under common control with You.
If an individual exercises rights on behalf of a legal entity, that legal
entity and its controlled, controlling, and commonly controlled entities are
the Organization. "Control" means direct or indirect ownership of more than
50% of the voting interests, or the power to direct management and policies.

"Product" means any product, application, service, or deployment that uses,
incorporates, is based on, or is derived from the Software.

"Monthly Active User" or "MAU" means a unique natural person who, during a
calendar month, actively uses or interacts with a Product. A person is
counted only once per calendar month across all accounts, devices, Product
instances, deployments, and affiliates within the Organization. Each
automated agent, service account, or API client counts as one MAU unless it
acts solely for a natural person already counted that month, in which case
it does not add another MAU. Reasonable, consistently applied methods may be
used to deduplicate users.

"Annual License Period" means each consecutive twelve-month period beginning
on the effective date of the applicable commercial agreement.

